  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "The All Seasons Collection 30A is pleased to offer this wonderful cottage as part of our distinctive collection of homes exclusively located in the town of Rosemary Beach <br>Step into this newly refurbished Rosemary cottage, and step it up a notch in your Rosemary Beach vacation experience. This comfortably chic residence has everything you would want for your Rosemary Beach getaway. A spacious outdoor courtyard/dining. Just around the corner from the town center and only minutes to the beach! A floating steel staircase is the focal point of this stylishly chic home, great-for-entertaining and state-of the-art beach house. Climb the architecturally intriguing staircase to the second floor which offers two master suites, each with their own private bath, double sinks and separate tub. Each master bedroom offer its own private porch with views of the local scene. Step it up even higher and find a third floor loft space furnished with two cozily nestled bunk bed sets, and private bath and shower, TVand board games (third floor not recommended for small children).<br>The open first-floor plan conveniently connects the kitchen (stainless appliances, island for entertaining) with the dining and living room spaces to keep company and conversation flowing. A separate sitting room with all new furniture Smart TV offers a private retreat for guests seeking a little solace from the abundance of activities. A outdoor courtyard with natural gas grill, beautiful water feature and dinning area welcomes guests to the pleasure of morning coffee, mid day lemonade or evening cocktails.<br>For local activity beyond the beach this home is just a short walk from the year round Sky Pool and tennis courts as well as the town center shops, restaurants and beautiful beach.<br>So what are you waiting for, begin planning your getaway beach vacation now.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
